{"id":"635133","name":"西红柿凉糕","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/635133/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"400克(取350克净西红柿汁)"},{"name":"豌豆粉","amount":"110克"},{"name":"凉水","amount":"400克(其中用100克调豌豆粉)"},{"name":"糖","amount":"80克"}],"sub":[{"name":"椰蓉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好400克西红柿。","img":"images/635133/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"顶部划十字刀，用开水烫一下。","img":"images/635133/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"去皮。","img":"images/635133/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切成大块。","img":"images/635133/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用料理机打成汁。","img":"images/635133/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"过滤一下。","img":"images/635133/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"克西红柿汁。","img":"images/635133/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"克豌豆粉+100克凉水。","img":"images/635133/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"化开。","img":"images/635133/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入西红柿汁里面，搅拌均匀，加80克糖，再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/635133/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"起锅烧水(300克水)。","img":"images/635133/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"水开后，慢慢倒入西红柿豌豆汁。","img":"images/635133/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"不停的搅拌均匀，以免糊底。","img":"images/635133/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"转小火，煮至微微冒泡即可。","img":"images/635133/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"倒入模具中，抹平，室温晾至凝固(2个小时左右)。","img":"images/635133/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"倒扣出来。","img":"images/635133/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"切成小方块。","img":"images/635133/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"滚上椰蓉。","img":"images/635133/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/635133/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/635133/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/635133/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"来一口，冰冰凉凉的，味道不错。","img":"images/635133/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}